# Feedback animations (mandatory)

**Every new or edited SPA feature must ship motion feedback** — do not wait for the user to ask.

Read `_System_Core/005_SPA_UX_Patterns.md` § **Feedback animations & hover (mandatory)**.

## Shared kit — `appFeedbackMotion.tsx`

Import from `@/app/components/layout/appFeedbackMotion`:

| Export | When |
|--------|------|
| `AppPressable` | Custom header/modal buttons (hover lift + tap scale) |
| `AppSuccessNotice` | After save/submit/complete — animated green banner |
| `AppErrorBanner` | Load/validation failures — animated red panel |
| `AppSectionEnter` / `AppStepSwitch` | Page sections or wizard steps |
| `AppTaskCompletePanel` | Multi-line success / process done state |
| `appHeaderActionClass` | Guide + muted header actions |
| `appHoverCard` / `appHoverRow` | Clickable cards and table rows |

**Modals:** use `AppModal` (open/close spring already built-in). **shadcn `Button`:** has tap scale + hover shadow — use for form CTAs.

**CSR fulfillment:** may still use `onlineFulfillmentMotion.tsx` aliases; new exec/inventory/deliveries code prefers `appFeedbackMotion`.

## Checklist before finishing UI work

1. **Buttons** — `Button`, `AppPressable`, or `appHeaderActionClass`; never flat unstyled `<button>` without hover/tap
2. **Modals** — `AppModal` only; close control has press feedback
3. **Success** — `AppSuccessNotice`, toast, or `AppTaskCompletePanel` after mutations
4. **Errors** — `AppErrorBanner` or `AppErrorNotice` with enter/exit
5. **Clickable rows/cards** — `appHoverRow` / `appHoverCard` or motion row components
6. **`useReducedMotion()`** — disable decorative motion when user prefers reduced motion

## Do not ship

- Static green/red `<p>` flash messages without `AnimatePresence`
- Primary actions with no hover or press feedback
- New modals without `AppModal` enter/exit animation
